cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this local release candidate and the pinned upstream contributions. This candidate is not yet published."
type: software
title: "Integer-multiplication pricing: quadratic screening and exact fallback audit"
version: "1.0.0-rc.1"
authors:
  - family-names: JIN
    given-names: HANZHE
    affiliation: "Independent Researcher, Chongqing, China"
    email: jinhanzhe09@gmail.com
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >
  A retrospective, source-bound pricing experiment on one fixed integer-multiplication
  construction invoice. Compares certified quadratic screens with two exact evaluators
  and retains mandatory fallback for surviving or inconclusive cases. Includes exact
  receipts, negative controls and 581 historical process-timing samples. No new
  multiplication complexity bound or search-wide speedup is claimed.
keywords:
  - integer multiplication
  - exact arithmetic
  - screening
  - reproducibility
  - benchmarking
